<p style=3D"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0">My apologies for the confusion. I=
 tried to Lojbanise my name (Timotheos or Timothy) but that doesn't make it=
 easily searchable (and the name doesn't Lojbanise that well anyway), so I'=
ll try to keep with the name I have
 on my email client.</p>
<p style=3D"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"><br>
</p>
<p style=3D"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0">I think karis was referring to th=
